flowchart LR
  oncall([On-call engineer]) -->|browser: review, approve| console[Sentinel web console]
  authors([Runbook authors]) -->|upload runbooks| console
  alerting([Prometheus + Alertmanager]) -->|webhook · integration token| platform
  console --> platform[Sentinel platform]
  oncall -->|sign in: OIDC| idp[(Identity provider<br/>Keycloak / company IdP)]
  idp -. user tokens, JWKS .-> platform
  platform -->|Messages API| claude[(Anthropic Claude)]
  platform -->|optional, local| ollama[(Ollama: gemma4)]
  platform -->|read-only telemetry + probes via MCP| services[(Production services:<br/>deploys, logs, metrics)]
  platform -->|approved action only · single-use capability| deploytool[(Team deploy tooling<br/>rollback · restart · pool · failover · scale)]
  deploytool --> services
  alerting -. scrapes .-> services
